Looking at this problem, I need to determine $\bigcap_{p \in \mathbb{N}^*} U_{1/p}$ where $U_{1/p} = \bigcup_{k \in \mathbb{N}} \left(r_k - \frac{1/p}{2^k}, r_k + \frac{1/p}{2^k}\right)$.

